{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "25193853a4b44a1c1e03ccab49a1ef6f88a99ec3bce1e1877720484d866e050b", "ja": "ひとり落ち込む歩のもとに、のり子、昴、プ\nロデューサーが訪れる。話すうちに初心を思\nい出す歩。一方、順調なはずの真も違和感を\n覚えていた。エレナの言葉で、歩と話す大切\nさに気付き、スタジオを飛び出していく。", "zh": "独自一人消沉的步身边，典子、昴和制作人来访。谈话间，步回想起了自己的初心。另一方面，本应进展顺利的真也感到一丝违和。听了艾莱娜的话，她意识到与步交谈的重要性，冲出了摄影棚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1000_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7559ec7337c8e14b0776a530a29e68cc095738b628e7c5b84afbcddb3a407254", "ja": "はあ～……。\nなんでこうなっちゃったんだろ……。", "zh": "唉～……  \n怎么会变成这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d8c3caff4517d0d3e0f12f40ca74d6e4b1d1b452e9d32e0ff20bf0e1d601e48c", "ja": "戻ったら、{$P$}と真に謝らないと。\nアタシのせいで、迷惑かけちゃったし……。", "zh": "回去之后，得向{$P$}和真道歉才行。毕竟还因为我给你们添麻烦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2a015bbb17b43047896047dbc3980708eb9c467d4c1fa8467d5fd8e08a5f6c7f", "ja": "ああ、いたいた！　やっぱりこの辺にいたか。", "zh": "啊，找到了！果然在这附近啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "361c7d4b5294a122ebae7f28b1401920a0da31924c465a067a28e6d2e110a8b3", "ja": "あれ、{$P$}！？\nひとりで大丈夫って言ったのに……！", "zh": "哎，{$P$}！？\n我都说了我一个人没问题的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2bcf63d1029573a355b059d041e22c65ae5a6f11b22ef28c9ae9c337868b7a3a", "ja": "いや、俺もちょっと風に当たろうと思って。\nそれに……。", "zh": "没有，我也只是想吹吹风。\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "29066043c0958c25c4f8bab48938da9ab6f564680d5dfab55ec11ebbfb64eaf6", "ja": "じゃーん♪　歩、お疲れー！", "zh": "锵锵♪ 歩，辛苦啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c77661a70e3032e806651b0c7f871bc8536d7ab372bdecc19b306aa1a02b33f3", "ja": "のり子、昴！　どうしたの！？", "zh": "纪子、昴！怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "2a8df431177cdfa9e9347815c83939701ea170cde9c1430e42e6bfe5ee5dae77", "ja": "ちょうど撮影が終わったトコ。\nそしたら偶然、{$P$}に会ってさ！", "zh": "正好刚拍完。  \n然后碰巧遇到了{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "8192026660ab7c976ef7c63279dc018b901a4aca9431d193016837427f104573", "ja": "聞いたよ～？\nレコーディング、上手くいってないんだって？", "zh": "听说啦～？听说录音进展得不太顺利？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b1ca7b0ab314f7f972d7f4f9fa688c3d09c38ddfaa8cb4274c63a08c93fd20e8", "ja": "うっ……そ、そうなんだよ。\nいやまあ、アタシが悪いんだけどさ。", "zh": "呃……是、是这样啦。\n哎呀，虽然也是我自己的问题就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "542adec52ce683ecdc37508acde5d56a7665ba542c2286b3c6e501bfb95b9d98", "ja": "アタシがこの曲で表現したいこととか、\n自分の中ではうわーってあるんだけど……", "zh": "我想通过这首歌表达的东西，还有自己心里那种“哇——”的感觉，虽然是有的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "77ab3a5465202960156c3cb34d11a5b50d65bed9688b66b035ce00bd96a2d01d", "ja": "うまく言葉にできなくて。\nほら、アタシ、専門用語とかわからないし……。", "zh": "就是没法用语言好好表达出来。你看，我也不懂什么专业术语……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "96ed9fac5df37a7f0212d51995aae13c0f75e6a76ffb6057fe4e0ae7fee49451", "ja": "あ～、日常会話とは違うもんね～。\nあれ？　でも通訳さんいるんじゃなかったっけ？", "zh": "啊～，毕竟跟日常对话不一样嘛～。\n咦？不过不是有翻译在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4688903195771879b8f1205e00f7bdcb65474b76ff48137c796d9086f913c68b", "ja": "そ、そうなんだけどさ。なんかもうこんがらがって、\n訳してもらいたい言葉も、わかんなくなって……。", "zh": "对、对啊，是这么回事。可不知道怎么的，脑子都乱成一团了，连想让人翻译的话都不知道该说什么了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "412dbf26efbefe94a63a8ee58568e0efc56b6e5676741d9a1fd7b7dc8b2f866c", "ja": "ありゃー、そっか。\nでもさ、わかんなくていいんじゃない？", "zh": "哎呀～这样啊。\n不过，搞不懂不也挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "a5fd25ebf02aa441fb7ad571321041662bf84f1d77791e5d36d1cd7feca14f3c", "ja": "歩、初めてニューヨーク来た時は、英語できなかったん\nでしょ？　今も、その時と同じでしょ？", "zh": "小步第一次来纽约的时候，不会英语吧？现在也和那时候一样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d5672260924361d97195149227d5282315a076ffbf2bd51a3765f8fb0732fad3", "ja": "……。のり子……。", "zh": "……诺莉子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "0dee76a30c152d52eb34c49ed8501222b07bda304b909b7fc9a13d0322193b6f", "ja": "大丈夫だよ！　なんとかわかってもらえるって。\n要は気持ちだって、昨日歩も言ってたじゃん！", "zh": "没事的！总能让对方明白的啦。\n步昨天不也说了嘛，关键在于心意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "ecbcf2c729f83eda904e85c47655ca5becfffe64fc12538f6fc3af11b9ac0f4a", "ja": "そうだよ歩！　オレ、よくわかってないかもだけどさ。\nとにかくボール投げなきゃ、野球は始まらないぜ！", "zh": "就是啊，步！我可能也没太搞明白，但总之，不把球投出去，棒球就没法开始啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6caf37f7b3eb28edf37a7736b54210f8e203013351aa886bb69919c94fca4c2d", "ja": "……あはは、何それ。気軽にいってくれるよな～。\nでも……そうだよね。ありがと、二人とも！", "zh": "……啊哈哈，什么嘛。你说得倒挺轻巧～\n不过……确实是这样呢。谢谢你们两个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9c18906351319b0feb59961e70dbb598c0203e97a1519bcade33df341168ba7d", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。アタシ、話してみる！\nちゃんと伝わるかは、わかんないけど……。", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。我去试着说说看！\n虽然不知道能不能好好传达……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "bac9e44b7c0dcd3e61d86c8933640f79f9b67f7b4a6028ce1d1a5c2f44867e81", "ja": "うん。それがいいと思う。\n気持ちがあれば、きっと歩の思いは伝わるよ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得这样就好。只要有这份心意，步的想法一定能传达出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "28f032c7e5fa7b0be8d56038f9789dc7766fd87e50a1fc2701602018401464ad", "ja": "そうだよね……。アイドルになってから、\nなんとなくうまくいってたから、忘れてたのかも。", "zh": "是啊……成为偶像之后，好像一直都挺顺利的，所以可能就忘了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2005b7742c25bd04a59d8e940a50ccc5d762252b9b23770328620ecc62f1ff3a", "ja": "何にも考えずに日本を飛び出した、あの頃の気持ち。\nわからないことだらけの国で、いつも体当たりでさ。", "zh": "那时不顾一切地离开日本时的心情。\n在一个充满未知的国度里，总是凭着一股冲劲去面对一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "663320305ad8dc6937a156b924cd278ffc9a1c62dada16aaadf9d80f2527336e", "ja": "毎日を必死に生きて……\nでも、ダンスへの気持ちだけは、手放さなかったんだ。", "zh": "拼命地过好每一天……\n但对舞蹈的这份心情，我始终没有放手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "d0625207a1bcd1746ae2ba58858eb9e39ec669b03a89d557bc37790e6d0267a5", "ja": "歩……。", "zh": "步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0bb0f1b48bb8b2ef9a8eedda7f6601fa98568775a36e24e02ab474de103460b3", "ja": "……な、なーんてね！\nあははっ、ちょっとカッコつけすぎた？", "zh": "……才、才不是呢！\n啊哈哈，我是不是装得太帅了点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1027_043nor", "source_sha256": "78c5a49f290045ba70647d7f2ef4ec4952fd8b2b92136f80de224c6f09656a1c", "ja": "……ううん、別に。\nだって歩、カッコいいもん。", "zh": "……没、没什么。\n因为小步很帅嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0d812effb30c5442aa099a3f65a453dea5c69f8941473a8cdaf58fe0790c5520", "ja": "そ、そう？　へへっ、やめろってのり子、\nそんなの……照れるじゃん！", "zh": "是、是吗？嘿嘿，别说了，法子，这种话……会让人害羞的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "315f145ac09c720471fc540e995c008625da51b0b544b83cca64602c7bb35035", "ja": "ところでさ！　さっきから、馬がウロウロ\nしてるんだけど、あれって何やってんの？", "zh": "对了！刚才开始就有匹马一直晃来晃去的，那是在干什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dffdb121bc313fb9a2fb5b756491be89596f55d0b7f2e97a2992bb03fab8af09", "ja": "え？　ああ、あれは騎馬警官。NYPDが……\nつまり警察が、馬に乗ってパトロールしてるんだよ。", "zh": "咦？啊，那是骑警。NYPD……也就是警察骑着马在巡逻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "f94e4d8a0c5ac3ac490b185fa6fe2487e440e8858bd6ef605d31f8a5d1cb1eff", "ja": "マジかよ、すげーカッコいいな！\nオレ、近くで見てくる！", "zh": "真的假的，太酷了！\n我去近处看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "14e3149e3612f18e49308b9287c1272a162e6e026af7c5b4c08c7b7a0ff6eede", "ja": "あ、待ってよ昴！　アタシも馬、見たーい！", "zh": "啊，等等我，昴！我也想去看看马——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "5fc059b449dbb5e41edd20a967ba8a0f1c2ad3ecedb0ae0f69a3e4ba59f10fa4", "ja": "あっ、ふたりとも！　はあ、追いかけるか。\n歩、悪いけど……。", "zh": "啊，你们两个！唉，追上去吧。\n步，不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "635c26baa764996fb80a99114371352c01c00366f41dcc14ea8942f1f2b6bcfc", "ja": "うん、アタシ、先に戻ってるよ。\n曲のこと、ちゃんと話さないといけないし！", "zh": "嗯，我先回去了。\n毕竟必须好好谈谈关于曲子的事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "1cbb752ccea434d00fbae060627f40a65d0ef875a020a206e85819f5be254c97", "ja": "……わかった。じゃあ、のり子たちと合流したら\nスタジオに戻るから。またスタジオでな！", "zh": "……知道了。那我跟法子她们汇合之后\n就回演播室。待会儿演播室见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "acd960bc735921c4da739317a896e57e639d5b2702c3ef56f5eb85c234c5d26a", "ja": "ふう……やっぱり、何か違う気がするな……。\n何がおかしいんだろう？", "zh": "呼……果然还是觉得有哪里不对劲……\n到底是哪里出了问题呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1037_018ele", "source_sha256": "fd10d0d8588ae95868c86aa63690e31cfceb6b1c93527ff664481613c4b7e479", "ja": "お疲れさまだヨ～、マコト♪\nこの曲、とーっても元気になる曲だネ！", "zh": "辛苦啦～真♪  \n这首歌真是让人超级精神呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1038_006mak", "source_sha256": "5b0e2e0ea392b802a487e19e742de85b123c7bade7fd8751b3f710eab748c87e", "ja": "あっ、エレナ！　来てたんだね。\n撮影はもう終わったの？", "zh": "啊，艾莲娜！你已经来啦。\n拍摄已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1039_018ele", "source_sha256": "4c067f876ca6ec7b2af2a0aa615cff86569f213563156a8cdbf24418b3bad263", "ja": "ウン、ノリコとスバルも、ノリノリだったノ！\nアイラブニューヨーク！　って感じで決めてきたヨ♪", "zh": "嗯，纪子和昴也都特别来劲呢！\n感觉就像在喊“我爱纽约！”一样，摆出帅气的姿势回来了哟♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1040_006mak", "source_sha256": "f94d6eed07c528eae093e49e365788a53f1fb7ce641f6a682cd921c4da324191", "ja": "あははっ、そっか。みんな、やっぱりすごいな……。\nボクも、気合いを入れ直して頑張らないと！", "zh": "啊哈哈，这样啊。大家果然都好厉害啊……\n我也得重新打起精神来加油才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1041_018ele", "source_sha256": "c06a88bee1ec71ce0ac4b1228fd32223f680c001f99c964d112d0b410ac04fb9", "ja": "マコトはもう気合いバッチリだと思うヨー。\n今も、ワタシに気づかないくらい集中してたでショ？", "zh": "我觉得真已经干劲十足了哦——  \n刚才不也是专注到连我都没注意到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1042_006mak", "source_sha256": "14c364eb86e1f78f14187db233799fb7a0f236c0eb856c9d6502c8936f012086", "ja": "そうだけど……。なんだか、カンが掴めないんだ。\n何度やっても、これだっていうのがわからなくて……。", "zh": "是这样没错……但总觉得抓不到感觉。\n不管试多少次，都不知道哪种才是对的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1043_018ele", "source_sha256": "92e87b5b13965ee8b52239eb344041e7e3be1e0ed3da9d60099b4ab498751431", "ja": "そうなノ……。あれ、アユムはいないノ？\nこの曲って、マコトとアユムの曲だよネ？", "zh": "是这样没错……咦，步不在吗？\n这首歌不是小真和步的歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1044_006mak", "source_sha256": "3b0643cc482d4d53cc8b0e3eef9e7a96af5e8f49964a6b53f3129793e01369c6", "ja": "えっ？　あ、うん、そうだけど……。", "zh": "咦？啊，嗯，是这样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1045_018ele", "source_sha256": "fe2197cd62597b563f1859a0cea02abb9e6275a02feeefd6c4ad3469f164cac0", "ja": "ワタシね、Cleaskyの時はミヤとふたりで、\nいっぱい遊んだり、話したりしたんだヨ。", "zh": "我呀，在Cleasky的时候，和美也两个人一起玩了好多，也聊了好多哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1046_018ele", "source_sha256": "37e31eb0f9cb35d592f79c0cf73fa0f5c41c5055935fc50ae770bed0fe4c9c00", "ja": "だからマコトも、アユムとふたりで\n一緒に悩んだほうがいいと思うナ♪", "zh": "所以我觉得真也应该和步一起烦恼才好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1047_006mak", "source_sha256": "b384064562ce7fc2f5f8c3d1db5a80447bd73cb9f672675c36806bca22e00a39", "ja": "ふたりで……。\nそうだ……これは、ボク達の曲だった。", "zh": "两个人一起……  \n对了……这是属于我们的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_04_1048_006mak", "source_sha256": "2bc5adcf5098d7e1d7db01f8e7c3ddd0df6b974abedebca5a9c6000a01f6e35e", "ja": "ありがとう、エレナ！　{$P$}には、\nすぐ戻るって伝えといて！", "zh": "谢谢你，艾莲娜！帮我跟{$P$}\n说一声，我马上就回去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
